altar on level 1, and you can imagine that I got an artifact weapon quite
early in that game, which makes life for my healer much, much easier.  In
other games I had not a single altar or coaligned temple in the whole
game.  Usually I play both types of games, the easier and the harder ones.
But imagining that each game is always quite in a comparable difficulty
range... no.

